  "priority_order_for_new_pc": [
    "Step 1: pull repo with `git pull origin claude/analyze-bot-strategy-MqYty`",
    "Step 2: install requirements with `pip install -r requirements.txt`",
    "Step 3: copy .env (Upstox API key/secret) — DO NOT commit to git",
    "Step 4: log in via dashboard once to populate state/upstox_session.json",
    "Step 5: run downloads in this order:",
    "  5a (CRITICAL): NIFTY spot — `python -m backtesting.download_spot_vix --symbol nifty`",
    "  5b (CRITICAL): INDIA_VIX — same command, different symbol",
    "  5c (CRITICAL): NIFTY options — `python -m backtesting.nifty_historical_downloader`",
    "  5d (CRITICAL): SENSEX spot+options — `python -m backtesting.sensex_historical_downloader`",
    "  5e (HIGH):     NIFTY futures — `python -m backtesting.nifty_futures_downloader`",
    "  5f (HIGH):     NIFTY futures stitch — `python -m backtesting.nifty_futures_continuous`",
    "  5g (MEDIUM):   BANKNIFTY everything (need new scripts AI will write)",
    "  5h (LOW):      BANKEX everything (need new scripts AI will write)",
    "Step 6: commit all data — `git add data/ && git commit -m 'data: full refresh' && git push`"
  ],

